0..49 Comment "//! A rule term can abstract an atom over a term."
50..53 Comment "//!"
54..115 Comment "//! A `bind (a : N) . T` port accepts `bind a . t` in a rule."
116..119 Comment "//!"
120..192 Comment "//! Admission re-mints each atom at its binder depth. The kernel matches"
193..254 Comment "//! alpha-equivalent terms and analyses their critical pairs."
255..329 Comment "//! A `Theory` value keeps each written atom and variable. The restriction"
330..368 Comment "//! signature is in `bind-port.gandr`."
369..372 Comment "//!"
373..425 Comment "//! - cites: [Gabbay-2009-nominal_universal_algebra]"
